.\" Manpage for xdg-rmdups by user <user@host>

.TH "xdg-rmdups" "1" "2013-12-04" "user" "XDG Storage"

.SH NAME

xdg-rmdups - Entfernt doppelte Dateien aus dem Storage

.SH SYNOPSIS

xdg-rmdups [ -d path/to/XDG_STORAGE_DIR ]

.SH DESCRIPTION

Entfernt doppelte Dateien (Duplikate) aus XDG_STORAGE_DIR, indem es
diese nach $HOME/Backup/ verschiebt.

.SH OPTIONS

.SS -h, --help

Shows help options.

.SS -d, --directory

Alt. XDG_STORAGE_DIR.

.SS -b, --backup

Alt. backup directory.  Default: $HOME/Backup/

Wenn kein Backup benötigt wird:

.nf
xdg-rmdups -b /dev/null

.SH SEE ALSO

.BR xdg-storage (1)

